  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 408.12 Drug Takeback Program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 408.12 Drug Takeback Program. Subject to RSA 318-E and Jus 1600, no permit shall be required for the collection, storage, and transfer to an authorized disposal facility of pharmaceutical drugs as defined in RSA 318-E:1.\n\nSource. #14093, eff 10-4-24\n\nAppendix\n\nEdit. Insert comma.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw400.html"
